iers helped define the sound of high-gain guitar tones in the 1980s and beyond, influencing countless players and builders throughout the industry.</p><br>\n<p>The result is a fascinating combination of two worlds: the enormous iron, power, and authority of a vintage Marshall Major paired with the expertise and circuit refinement of one of the most respected amp designers ever to pick up a soldering iron. The amp delivers the huge low end, commanding punch, and unmistakable presence that made the Major famous while benefiting from Soldano's thoughtful modifications.</p><br>\nSpecs:<br>\n<br>\n200 Watts<br>\n<br>\nTone Stack and Gain Structure modded by Mike Soldano<br>\n<br>\nNo codes on transformers (Match the originals, power transformer has writing on it)<br>\n<br>\n<strong>For an in hand description please call 747.388.2929</strong><br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;","condition":{"uuid":"ae4d9114-1bd7-4ec5-a4ba-6653af5ac84d","display_name":"Very Good","slug":"very-good"},"price":{"tax_included":false,"amount":"6500.00","amount_cents":650000,"currency":"USD","symbol":"$","display":"$6,500"},"buyer_price":{"tax_included":false,"amount":"6500.00","amount_cents":650000,"currency":"USD","symbol":"$","display":"$6,500"},"inventory":1,"has_inventory":false,"offers_enabled":false,"categories":[{"uuid":"19d53222-297e-410c-ba4f-b48678e917f9","full_name":"Amps / Guitar Amps / Guitar Heads"}],"listing_currency":"USD","published_at":"2026-06-18T23:52:28-05:00","state":{"slug":"live","description":"Live"},"auction":false,"shop_id":88540,"shipping":{"free_expedited_shipping":false,"local":true,"rates":[{"region_code":"US_CON","rate":{"amount":"300.00","amount_cents":30000,"currency":"USD","symbol":"$","display":"$300"},"carrier_calculated":false,"regional":false,"destination_postal_code_needed":false}],"initial_offer_rate":{"region_code":"US_CON","rate":{"original":{"amount":"300.00","amount_cents":30000,"currency":"USD","symbol":"$","display":"$300"},"display":{"amount":"300.00","amount_cent